sarif-schema-2.1.0.json is the JSON schema of the Static Analysis Results
Interchange Format (SARIF) Version 2.1.0, Errata 01, OASIS Standard,
copied unchanged from
https://docs.oasis-open.org/sarif/sarif/v2.1.0/errata01/os/schemas/sarif-schema-2.1.0.json
(sha256 c3b4bb2d6093897483348925aaa73af03b3e3f4bd4ca38cef26dcb4212a2682e).
It is used only by tests/test_reports.py, so that the tests never fetch it.

